HIVE-28191 found that the integration testing of Hbase 2.5.6 can not work with Hadoop 3.4.1. This is a known issue from Hbase community. Check HBASE-28908 & HBASE-28846 .

 

The workaround in HIVE-28191 is adding a property in *_org.apache.hadoop.hive.hbase.HBaseTestSetup.java_* :
{code:java}
hbaseConf.set("hbase.wal.provider", "filesystem"); {code}
 

The unreleased version of Hbase 2.7.0 has fixed this issue at its root. we can upgrade Hbase version once 2.7.0 is released. And remove _hbase.wal.provider_ from HBaseTestSetup.java.
